    "description": "<p style=\"border-width:0px;border-style:solid;margin:0px;font-family:'ABCRepro-Regular', sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">A mysterious girl appears in the lives of an elderly childless couple and a troubled young man and transforms their understanding about love and life.</p><p style=\"border-width:0px;border-style:solid;margin:0px;font-family:'ABCRepro-Regular', sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">Loosely based on the Russian fairy tale about Snegurochka, this story is about miracles , but also about trusting the divine forces at work.</p><p style=\"border-width:0px;border-style:solid;margin:0px;font-family:'ABCRepro-Regular', sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">The film is suitable for children as well as adults.</p><br style=\"border-width:0px;border-style:solid;font-family:'ABCRepro-Regular', sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\" /><p style=\"border-width:0px;border-style:solid;margin:0px;font-family:'ABCRepro-Regular', sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">Bulgaria, Estonia, Germany</p><br />",
